{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37764","headline":"宣义里舍冬暮自贻 · 郑谷","name":"宣义里舍冬暮自贻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽居不称在长安，沟浅浮春岸雪残。\n板屋渐移方带野，水车新入夜添寒。\n名如有分终须立，道若离心岂易宽。\n满眼尘埃驰骛去，独寻烟竹翦渔竿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}